{"title":"Bandit Tally Book","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Brigand</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"brigand\" title=\"Brigand - dropped it in 1 of 10 looted corpses (1/10)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fdd8c032b5f277aef224.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Brigand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bandit-tally-book\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/a4076cb7ec0ed13633d5.svg\" alt=\"Bandit Tally Book\"></div><h3>Bandit Tally Book</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/18/2026, 2:45:30 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}